    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - "... The <b>Locked Safe with Arrows</b>. It must be. The phrase must be applicable
      to Se\xF1or Rommel\u2019s belongings."
