    - <i>(This interference may gain me dishonor and judgement, but no amount of
      that would compare to the respect that Giyala needs.)</i>
    - "<i>(I sincerely hope that if not most, then one of our leaders will think
      this through. Servillano\u2026 you may be our last hope.)</i>"
