      value: bec719da-d8b0-4d26-a4af-27e544e67dfe
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3404549752580450967, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: id
      value: c8328923-64f0-47b9-8f70-43af18b173a0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextDialogue
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1824347165}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.name
      value: Liezel
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.soundToPlay
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linksToOtherDialogue
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: playClosingAnimation
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <i>(My magic led me to... these torn pages.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "\"\u2014 I decided to gift upon them an heirloom that has remained
        in our family for generations, may all who hold it share our ambitions to
        share the beauty of Giyala to all of the world.\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: "The other half of the passage has been torn... Oh, but there\u2019s
        more."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\u201CWhen I took my seat, I never expected to be surrounded by cowards.
        I thought we were the ones who swore to fight.\"\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\"The ones who took real action, unlike those idiots in the Kapisanan
        who cling to the esoteric\u2026\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[5]'
      value: "\u201CI must take action and wield the fate of the Disidensiyang Giyala
        in my own hands. Those bastards will not respond to reason.\"\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[6]'
      value: "\"My only hope of being understood lies with Servillano\u2014If I can
        convince him then perhaps-\u201D"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[7]'
      value: It cuts off there. Whatever his plans were, Servillano must not have
        approved, judging by the state of things now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: objectsToDeactivateAfter.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'objectsToDeactivateAfter.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1559566915}
    - target: {fileID: 5994212485817288540, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Torn Pages Pickup
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5994212485817288540, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
